{
  "_comment": [
    "A hand-authored demo day for --demo-json. Times are wall-clock, so the",
    "machine's clock picks the moment: pin it (sudo date -f '%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S'",
    "'2026-08-12 09:53:00') and the state is simply there — no waiting for a",
    "half-hour boundary and no drift from the 120s poll re-anchor.",
    "",
    "Days are offsets from today (0 today, 1 tomorrow), not calendar dates, so",
    "this file keeps working tomorrow.",
    "",
    "  swift run Until --demo-json scripts/demo-data-example.json",
    "  open Until.app --args --demo-json /path/to/demo-data-example.json",
    "",
    "The built-in scenarios (--demo-mode / --demo-now / --demo-overlap /",
    "--demo-free / --demo-notification) are unaffected; a fixture overrides",
    "them. Anything wrong in here stops the app with a message on stderr rather",
    "than falling back, so a typo can never hand back a subtly different shot."
  ],

  "config": {
    "menubarLeadMinutes": 45,
    "lookaheadHours": 48,
    "maxTitleLength": 48,
    "notifyEnabled": false,
    "notifyLeadMinutes": 5
  },

